# Corpus exclusions for the graphify knowledge graph.
# This is NOT a git ignore — both paths below are tracked on purpose. It only
# keeps them out of graphify-out/.
#
# These exclusions were applied by hand on the first build (2026-08-12) and were
# therefore lost the moment the post-commit hook ran a plain `graphify update .`,
# which re-ingested both. Written down here so they survive.

# Vendored, pinned (three: 0.160.0) and minified. Its identifiers are mangler
